62	     * {@code customerCode} ({@code '<REGION>-<HASH8>'}), the region-and-hash identity the owner is
63	     * assigned at creation. Falls back to resolving the region directly from the owner's postcode
64	     * range first ({@code NSW 2000-2099, VIC 3000-3099, QLD 4000-4099}), then the canonical region
